## Hints for Future Agents
--status deliberately overrides the active-only default: without that, --status Implemented would print nothing unless --all was also given. The hidden-plans note is suppressed under --status because its hint "(--all shows them)" would be false there. --status accepts only the six recognised values, so --status done is rejected even though the fixture has a plan whose ImplementationStatus is literally "done"; planner check is the tool for that. Named plans ignore --status, as they already ignored --repo. configs/herdr/config.toml was modified before this session and was intentionally left out of the commit.

## Codebase Discoveries
runGet and markVisible duplicated the visibility predicate; selects now owns it. In the tree, an ancestor that fails the filter still renders (with its REPO cell) so a matching descendant has a place, so tree-status.golden shows the InProgress widgets-umbrella above its Implemented children.

